  "question": {
    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>!</mo></math> is true for <math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  },
